  flip:'You cannot take 3 quarters from 1 quarter by doing 3 − 1. Break a whole into quarters: 3 5/4 − 2 3/4 = 1 2/4.',
  neg:'A negative part is not a finished answer. Regroup: 4 1/4 is 3 5/4, then 3 5/4 − 2 3/4 = 1 2/4.',
